@startuml
title VM / Compose option v1 (DESIGNED, single-host)
node VM {
node "Compose network" {
artifact "Java API" as api
artifact "Go worker (optional)" as worker
artifact "PostgreSQL" as db
}
artifact "Python scheduled report (optional)" as report
}
api --> db : SQL
worker --> db : outbox
report --> db : read-only snapshot
note bottom of VM : One host is a shared failure domain.
Backup must leave this host.
@enduml
